{
  "declaredLength": 6732,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être que je l’ai oublié à la maison... ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750074002D00EA00740072006500200071007500650020006A00650020006C2019006100690020006F00750062006C006900E9002000E00020006C00610020006D006100690073006F006E002E002E002E0020003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. Tu tombes bien.\nJe peux te demander quelque...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C00200010000201000000002E00200054007500200074006F006D0062006500730020006200690065006E002E000A004A006500200070006500750078002000740065002000640065006D0061006E0064006500720020007100750065006C007100750065002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... En fait, non, ça ira.\nJe vais demander à Anya.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002E002E002E00200045006E00200066006100690074002C0020006E006F006E002C002000E700610020006900720061002E000A004A006500200076006100690073002000640065006D0061006E006400650072002000E000200041006E00790061002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anya, est-ce que tu peux demander à Hoopa\nde faire quelque chose pour moi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Absolument pas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100620073006F006C0075006D0065006E00740020007000610073002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais je n’ai encore rien dit...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020006A00650020006E20190061006900200065006E0063006F007200650020007200690065006E0020006400690074002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vois clair dans ton jeu. Tu veux que je demande\nà Hoopa de te rapporter ce que tu as oublié.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nEt je refuse !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh... Mais... Pourtant, tu...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002E002E002E0020004D006100690073002E002E002E00200050006F0075007200740061006E0074002C002000740075002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moi, je ne demande l’aide de Hoopa que lorsque\nje dois me déplacer d’un hôtel à l’autre.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAinsi, j’évite de vous causer des soucis\ninutilement.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’autre part, Mère m’a toujours répété que\nla paresse était un vilain défaut.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu as raison. Je me repose peut-être trop\nsur <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> et la team...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200061007300200072006100690073006F006E002E0020004A00650020006D00650020007200650070006F0073006500200070006500750074002D00EA007400720065002000740072006F0070000A007300750072002000100002010000000020006500740020006C00610020007400650061006D002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai compris ! C’est à moi de régler mes affaires !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200063006F006D007000720069007300200021002000432019006500730074002000E00020006D006F00690020006400650020007200E90067006C006500720020006D0065007300200061006600660061006900720065007300200021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ! J’ai besoin de courage et\nje pense qu’un combat m’aidera à me motiver !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’attends dans la cour.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007420190061007400740065006E00640073002000640061006E00730020006C006100200063006F00750072002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allons voir de quelle manière Inno va exprimer\nsa détermination !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C006F006E007300200076006F006900720020006400650020007100750065006C006C00650020006D0061006E006900E80072006500200049006E006E006F002000760061002000650078007000720069006D00650072000A007300610020006400E9007400650072006D0069006E006100740069006F006E0020002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hoopaaa !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006F0070006100610061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !\nDonne tout ce que tu as !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000200021000A0044006F006E006E006500200074006F00750074002000630065002000710075006500200074007500200061007300A00021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne retiendrai pas mes coups !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E0065002000720065007400690065006E006400720061006900200070006100730020006D0065007300200063006F007500700073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends deux secondes.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E00640073002000640065007500780020007300650063006F006E006400650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’issue du combat m’importe peu. Ce qui compte,\nc’est de mettre ma détermination à l’épreuve.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je me demande combien de temps je vais pouvoir\ntenir tête <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЂauà la Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāea plus fort<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe d’Illumis...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moi qui espérais contempler l’étendue de la force\nde Baggaïd, je suis servie !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hoopaaa !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006F0070006100610061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Baggaïd ! Tu m’as toujours soutenu.\nÀ moi de te faire briller !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100670067006100EF0064002000210020005400750020006D20190061007300200074006F0075006A006F00750072007300200073006F007500740065006E0075002E000A00C00020006D006F00690020006400650020007400650020006600610069007200650020006200720069006C006C0065007200200021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toujours aussi redoutable, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais je ne suis pas surpris. En tout cas, je suis\nfier d’avoir pu t’affronter de toutes mes forces.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu as été fantastique, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !\nEt toi, Inno, tu as fait preuve d’un tel courage !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’ailleurs, j’ai du mal à comprendre.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPourquoi quelqu’un d’aussi courageux que\ntoi hésite-t-il à rentrer chez lui ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À dire vrai, j’aimerais bien voir ma petite sœur,\nmais j’ai peur du regard de ma grand-mère...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh... Pardon, ce n’est pas cool de te dire ça,\nalors que je sais que ta mère te manque...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce qui t’oblige à parler à ta grand-mère\nquand tu vas voir ta sœur ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E0020003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ta question me surprend, je ne m’y attendais pas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400610020007100750065007300740069006F006E0020006D00650020007300750072007000720065006E0064002C0020006A00650020006E00650020006D2019007900200061007400740065006E00640061006900730020007000610073002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je pense que les gens devraient davantage\nprendre soin d’eux, plutôt que de perdre<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nleur temps à faire ce qui leur déplaît.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si cela convient aux autres, tant mieux !\nDans le cas contraire, pourquoi s’en faire ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Baaag...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420061006100610067002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Baggaïd a l’air de partager ton avis...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100670067006100EF0064002000610020006C201900610069007200200064006500200070006100720074006100670065007200200074006F006E00200061007600690073002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon. Tu as raison. Je vais davantage penser\nà moi et à faire plaisir à ma sœur !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nComme ma grand-mère l’adore, mes efforts\nla feront peut-être changer d’avis sur moi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 173
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merveilleux ! Dans ce cas, je vais préparer\nun Donut spécial pour ta sœur adorée !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce sera un bon début pour améliorer tes relations\navec ta grand-mère !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bag bagga !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200610067002000620061006700670061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grâce à mes talents, je vais changer l’opinion\nqu’elle a de moi !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEt si ça marche, peut-être que j’arrêterai aussi\nde lui en vouloir.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ! En t’affrontant,\nj’ai regagné confiance en moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002C002000100002010000000020002100200045006E0020007420190061006600660072006F006E00740061006E0074002C000A006A201900610069002000720065006700610067006E00E900200063006F006E006600690061006E0063006500200065006E0020006D006F006900200021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’en suis reconnaissant. Je vais continuer à\npoursuivre mes rêves, aussi bien pour ma sœur<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nque pour les autres !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bagga...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420061006700670061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    }
  ],
